
#  Healthcare Data Analysis using Pandas

A real-world inspired data analysis project demonstrating how raw hospital encounter data can be cleaned, processed, and transformed into actionable insights using **Python & Pandas**.

This project focuses on handling missing values, filtering relevant information, and aggregating patient records to support better healthcare decision-making.

---

##  Business Problem

Hospitals generate massive patient encounter datasets.  
However, raw medical data often contains:

- Missing cost values
- Irrelevant columns
- Inconsistent records
- Unstructured information

Without cleaning and summarizing the data, hospitals cannot:
- Estimate treatment costs
- Analyze encounter types
- Understand payer distributions
- Improve operational efficiency

This project converts raw hospital records → meaningful healthcare insights.

---

## Objectives

- Clean real-world messy healthcare dataset
- Handle missing medical cost values
- Filter important medical attributes
- Aggregate encounter records
- Extract business insights from patient data

---

##  Tech Stack

- Python
- Pandas
- Jupyter Notebook

---

##  Dataset Features Used

| Column | Description |
|------|------|
| Id | Encounter ID |
| Patients | Patient Identifier |
| ENCOUNTERCLASS | Type of encounter |
| BASE_ENCOUNTER_COST | Treatment cost |
| PAYER | Insurance provider |
| REASONDESCRIPTION | Medical reason |

---

##  Key Operations Performed

### 1. Data Exploration
- Loaded encounter dataset
- Checked data types and null values

### 2. Data Cleaning
- Identified missing values
- Replaced missing treatment costs using median values

### 3. Data Filtering
- Selected relevant medical columns
- Removed unnecessary attributes

### 4. Aggregation & Analysis
- Grouped encounters
- Summarized patient costs
- Analyzed payer distribution

---

##  Learning Outcomes

This project demonstrates practical data analyst skills:

✔ Data cleaning  
✔ Handling missing values  
✔ Feature selection  
✔ GroupBy aggregation  
✔ Business-oriented analysis  

